==Strategy==
Every enemy in this stage is on a timer, and the pushing power behind the stage is lacking as long as you have enough DPS. There are pretty much 2 options: Rushing the stage as soon as possible or slowly whittling down the enemies.

For rushing, focus on killing the first Wild Doge as fast as possible, then send [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut]] as soon as the Zollow attacks. Pair this with other fast cats such as [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier]], [[Crazed Tank Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Manic Eraser]], [[Express Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Maglev]], and [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can]] in order to protect Bahamut.

For stalling, Courier can suffice when meat-shielded well, although you have to be careful of Ariants as they can burrow and disrupt meatshields.

For both strategies, Attack Up and Research Up Combos can be helpful, allowing Bahamut and Courier to clear enemies faster and for more Courier spam.

